# logs: an mrepo's requests in a browser, its own request log.
# scene: a host; Splectral deployed and in service, at splectral
. boot/deploy host haiccing/base-component-haicc
. boot/deploy splectral haiccing/base-package-splectral
# step: the component's first half: a plain service-managed mrepo
splectral boot/deploy log haiccing/base-package-service
# expect: "deployed":"log"
# step: its second half: the viewer laid on top
splectral splectral/install log splectral/base-component-log-viewer
# expect: "installed":"log"
# step: its service, its program started
splectral/log service/initialise
# expect: "state":"initialised"
splectral/log service/start
# expect: "state":"started"
# step: what its page shows, as a command
host crud/read "done/*" --flags layer=request
# expect: "uri":["request","done/*[@offset=
# step: torn down through the platform, as any mrepo (Splectral reads no links of its own: its components are its to tear down)
splectral boot/teardown log
# expect: "tornDown":"log"
